+ *   dma/hdma.h          — struct dma_tx_desc 16-byte 4-DW descriptor layout
+ *                         + DESC_OWN_DMA (bit 31 of status DW3). The .own
+ *                         bitfield in the LE variant occupies bit 31 of
+ *                         status DW3 — DESC_OWN_DMA = 0x80000000 lights
+ *                         exactly that bit (cited in port_setup_tx_ring
+ *                         and ndo_start_xmit below).
+ *   dma/lantiq_dmax.h   — DMA1TX_LAN_SWITCH_CLASS0..3 encoded channel
+ *                         handles (CPU -> GSWIP-MAC admit family) +
+ *                         ltq_request_dma / ltq_free_dma /
+ *                         ltq_dma_chan_desc_cfg / ltq_dma_chan_on /
+ *                         ltq_dma_chan_off public API. Already pulled in
+ *                         transitively via dma/hdma.h (Sub-4B layered).
