+ *   datapath/datapath_api.h  - dp_alloc_port_ext / dp_register_subif /
+ *                              dp_dealloc_port_ext (all four LAN-port
+ *                              register/dealloc surfaces). dp_register_subif
+ *                              with DP_F_DEREGISTER OR'd into @flags is the
+ *                              canonical "deregister" entry per Sub-3
