+ *   dma/lantiq_dmax.h        - hdma_port_enable / hdma_port_disable
+ *                              (Sub-4B ndo_open step 1 / ndo_stop step 4).
+ *   tmu/drv_tmu_ll.h         - tmu_egress_port_enable(epn, bool)
