+ *                              codebase convention is a single
+ *                              enable(epn, bool ena) surface. Disable is
+ *                              tmu_egress_port_enable(epn, false). The
+ *                              plan text references tmu_egress_port_disable;
+ *                              this is a plan-vs-codebase naming
+ *                              adjustment recorded in the manifest notes.
